{
  "about": "Chat rooms on hidden NPCs (issue #1240): the Knight job test's 'Waiting Room' at job_knt 89,106 hangs on an NPC that hides itself (hideonnpc), and its board must still show and take clicks. Looked at only (joining starts the arena). Then npc/hidden-room.txt puts a hidden NPC with a plain room in alberta: the board is clicked, the room opens, Esc leaves it. Ends with the NPC unloaded.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "steps": [
    {"say": "@warp job_knt 89 101"},
    {"settle": 2000},
    {"move": [1000, 750]},
    {"expect": {"button": {"name": "room_sign"}}},
    {"shot": "knight-arena-room", "crop": [312, 40, 400, 300]},
    {"say": "@warp alberta 123 140"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"say": "@unloadnpcfile {repo}/.claude/skills/rustnarok-dev/npc/hidden-room.txt"},
